   "id": "e10",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      34.8,
      536.88,
      270.0,
      545.76
     ],
     "text": "‘Kirsten’ is a hybrid Hydrangea with low, bushy growth and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      34.32,
      547.68,
      269.52,
      556.56
     ],
     "text": "light green, oval leaves with acuminate apices. Venation of the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      34.32,
      558.72,
      269.76,
      567.36
     ],
     "text": "leaf is reticulate. The inflorescence is umbrella shaped and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      33.84,
      569.52,
      269.76,
      578.4
     ],
     "text": "flowers with a small calyx are inconspicuous. Sepals are"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      34.08,
      580.56,
      269.76,
      589.2
     ],
     "text": "blue/red and average 4-5. Overlapping of sepals is sometimes"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      34.08,
      591.36,
      203.28,
      600.0
     ],
     "text": "present and there is no incision of the sepals."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "‘Kirsten’ is a hybrid Hydrangea with low, bushy growth and\nlight green, oval leaves with acuminate apices. Venation of the\nleaf is reticulate. The inflorescence is umbrella shaped and\nflowers with a small calyx are inconspicuous. Sepals are\nblue/red and average 4-5. Overlapping of sepals is sometimes\npresent and there is no incision of the sepals.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text",
   "signal": "layout:ovisocr3-layout",
